        "style": "opacity:0",
        "class": "testimonial_component"
      },
      "text": "What people say about Tur.ai.\n\n.swiper-pagination.review-swiper {\n  position: relative;\n  left: 0 !important;\n  top: 0 !important; \n  bottom: 0 !important;\n  display: flex;\n  width: auto !important;  \n}\n\n.swiper-pagination.review-swiper .swiper-pagination-bullet {\n\twidth: 0.75rem;\n  height: 0.75rem;\n  background: white;\n  opacity: .5;\n  transition: opacity 0.35s ease;\n}\n\n.swiper-pagination.review-swiper .swiper-pagination-bullet.swiper-pagination-bullet-active {\t\n  background: white !important; \n  opacity: 1;\n}\n\n.swiper-slide.review-thumbs.swiper-slide-thumb-active .review_card-thumbs{\n\tborder-top-color: var(--white);\n}\n“Tur.ai has significantly enhanced our operational processes at Radio Holland, improving our efficiency and customer service. Their AI-driven solutions facilitate smooth and quick processing that meets our operational objectives. With Tur.ai, we are not only maintaining our industry standards but also striving to elevate them.”Faissel el MouridiCFO, Radio Holland"
    },
