        "class": "quote"
      },
      "text": "“Tur.ai has significantly enhanced our operational processes at Radio Holland, improving our efficiency and customer service. Their AI-driven solutions facilitate smooth and quick processing that meets our operational objectives. With Tur.ai, we are not only maintaining our industry standards but also striving to elevate them.”"
