        "style": "opacity:0",
        "class": "heading-style-h2"
      },
      "text": "Our Trademark Process Lets You Transform Your Retail Operations"
    },
    {
      "tag": "div",
      "attrs": {
        "data-w-id": "b0ff4f5b-a8f4-3988-84d9-f6f8ed7a652f",
        "style": "opacity:0",
        "class": "process_tabs-menu w-tab-menu"
      },
      "text": "EXPLORE/ 01EMPOWER/ 02THRIVE/ 03"
    },
    {
      "tag": "div",
      "attrs": {
        "data-w-id": "b0ff4f5b-a8f4-3988-84d9-f6f8ed7a6539",
        "style": "opacity:0",
        "class": "process_tabs-content w-tab-content"
      },
      "text": "In the pilot phase, Tur.ai will collaborate to identify a use case focused on enhancing internal workflows or elevating the custom erexperience. The goal is to develop a customized solution that clearly demonstrates tangible value.Following the pilot, we will offer valuable insights and construct a compelling business case to proceed with the rollout of Tur.ai's AI solution. This strategic deployment is designed to align with your objectives and to significantly boost customer satisfaction.Our service package includes comprehensive training and onboarding processes, ensuring a smooth team integration. This approach is aimed at delivering increased value across different business areas, supported by the continuous assistance from Tur.ai."
    },
