        "data-w-id": "c0677f68-585f-6d5c-d35f-a316be13c28a",
        "class": "process_card-wrapper is-mobile"
      },
      "text": "EXPLORE/ 01In the pilot phase, Tur.ai will collaborate to identify a use case aimed at either enhancing internal workflows or elevating the customer experience. The goal is to develop a customized solution that clearly demonstrates tangible value.EMPOWER/ 02Following the pilot, we will offer valuable insights and construct a compelling business case to proceed with the rollout of Tur.ai's AI solution. This strategic deployment is designed to align with your objectives and to significantly boost customer satisfaction.THRIVE/ 03Our service package includes comprehensive training and onboarding processes, ensuring a smooth team integration. This approach is aimed at delivering increased value across different business areas, supported by the continuous assistance from Tur.ai."
